==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{m|fr|naturaliste}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|dated}} A person committed to studying [[nature]] or [[natural history]].
# {{lb|en|philosophy}} A person who [[believe|believes]] in or [[advocate|advocates]] the tenets of [[philosophical]] or [[methodological]] [[naturalism]].

